# Preserve exact bytes: experiment manifests and source snapshots use SHA-256.
# In particular, CSVs may contain CRLF while Python/JSON files contain LF.
# Override local core.autocrlf so a clone keeps the original artifact hashes.
* -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol,-blank-at-eof
*.png binary
*.zip binary
